.el .ds Aq '
.TH wsblast-import 1  "wsblast-import 0.2.5" 
.SH NAME
wsblast\-import \- Write a scenario from a browser\*(Aqs HAR file: the messages one recorded WebSocket connection sent, with its pauses
.SH SYNOPSIS
\fBwsblast import\fR [\fB\-o\fR|\fB\-\-output\fR] [\fB\-\-url\fR] [\fB\-\-index\fR] [\fB\-c\fR|\fB\-\-connections\fR] [\fB\-d\fR|\fB\-\-duration\fR] [\fB\-\-max\-wait\fR] [\fB\-\-no\-waits\fR] [\fB\-h\fR|\fB\-\-help\fR] <\fIFILE.har\fR> 
.SH DESCRIPTION
Write a scenario from a browser\*(Aqs HAR file: the messages one recorded WebSocket connection sent, with its pauses
.SH OPTIONS
.TP
\fB\-o\fR, \fB\-\-output\fR \fI<FILE>\fR
Write the scenario to FILE instead of stdout
.TP
\fB\-\-url\fR \fI<TEXT>\fR
Import the connection whose URL contains TEXT
.TP
\fB\-\-index\fR \fI<N>\fR
Import the Nth matching connection, from 1 [default: the one that sent the most messages]
.TP
\fB\-c\fR, \fB\-\-connections\fR \fI<N>\fR [default: 10]
Connections of the generated phase
.TP
\fB\-d\fR, \fB\-\-duration\fR \fI<DURATION>\fR [default: 1m]
Duration of the generated phase
.TP
\fB\-\-max\-wait\fR \fI<DURATION>\fR [default: 10s]
The longest pause kept between messages; longer ones are shortened to it
.TP
\fB\-\-no\-waits\fR
Leave out the recorded pauses: send each message as soon as the last one is answered
.TP
\fB\-h\fR, \fB\-\-help\fR
Print help
.TP
<\fIFILE.har\fR>
HAR file exported from the browser\*(Aqs network panel (Chrome and Edge record WebSocket messages in it)
.SH VERSION
v0.2.5
